---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository.

They do NOT cover the 3D models and textures under models/. Those come from
third parties under their own terms -- see "Asset Credits" in README.md. Do not
assume they are redistributable.

Third-party libraries are downloaded at build time and are not redistributed in
this repository. They remain under their own licenses:

  glm                 MIT (also available under The Happy Bunny License)
  stb                 MIT / public domain (dual)
  GLFW                zlib/libpng
  GLEW                Modified BSD / MIT
  assimp              3-clause BSD
  marl                Apache License 2.0
  Open Image Denoise  Apache License 2.0
  oneTBB              Apache License 2.0

Binaries produced by the CI workflow bundle the Open Image Denoise and oneTBB
DLLs; both are Apache 2.0 and require their license text to travel with them.

This ray tracer follows Peter Shirley's "Ray Tracing in One Weekend" series,
whose accompanying code the authors have released into the public domain
(CC0-1.0). Sampling routines follow Kevin Suffern's "Ray Tracing from the
Ground Up".
